---
title: Christmas Mincemeat
author: Jonathan Simmonds
servings: 1
yields: 450%g
---

Mix @mixed fruit{300%g}, @apple or pear{1}(grated), @lemon juice{15%ml}, @brandy{75%ml}, @dark muscavado{25%g}, @mixed spice{1%tsp}, @ginger{0.5%tsp}, @cloves{0.5%tsp}, and @chia seeds{10%g} together, making sure the sugar is well mixed in.

Let it soak for ~{24%hours}, ideally for ~{2-3%days} until the liquid is absorbed, stirring occasionally.
